msgstr "`Verifica dei permessi`_ con PHP."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:14
msgid "`Understanding Permissions`_ in phpBB."
msgstr "`Comprendere i permessi`_ in phpBB."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:17
msgid "Create permissions"
msgstr "Crea permessi"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:19
msgid "There are four permission types:"
msgstr "Ci sono quattro tipi di permessi:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:21
msgid "``a_*`` Administrator"
msgstr "``a_*`` Amministratore"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:22
msgid "``m_*`` Moderator"
msgstr "``m_*`` Moderatore"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:23
msgid "``u_*`` User"
msgstr "``u_*`` Utente"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:24
msgid "``f_*`` Forum"
msgstr "``f_*`` Forum"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/extensions/tutorial_permissions.rst:26
msgid ""
"You can create new permissions for each of these types and assign them to "
"user groups or permission roles. You can also define new roles to assign "
"your permissions to if desired."
msgstr ""
"Puoi creare nuovi permessi per ciascuno di questi tipi e assegnarli a gruppi"
" di utenti o ruoli di permesso. Puoi anche definire nuovi ruoli a cui "
"assegnare i tuoi permessi, se lo desideri."

